# 2. Proposed idea: "Application Health & Troubleshooting Runbook"

Create one master process:

```text
Incident / Deployment Issue
          |
          v
   Identify Problem Type
          |
   +------+-------+--------+---------+
   |              |        |         |
   v              v        v         v
Deployment     Network   Application Database
   |              |        |         |
   +--------------+--------+---------+
                  |
                  v
          Run Diagnostic Tests
                  |
                  v
          Identify Root Cause
                  |
                  v
          Apply Remediation
                  |
                  v
             Test Again
                  |
                  v
          Login with Test User
                  |
                  v
          Business Validation
                  |
                  v
             Close Issue
```

The important part is that **every issue follows the same sequence**.

