# 4. First step when an incident occurs

I recommend having a standard **Incident Classification**.

### Step 1 — What exactly is failing?

```text
Is application completely unavailable?
        |
        +-- YES → Availability troubleshooting
        |
        +-- NO
             |
             v
Is only one functionality failing?
             |
             +-- YES → Application troubleshooting
             |
             +-- NO
                  |
                  v
Is issue happening only after deployment?
                  |
                  +-- YES → Deployment troubleshooting
                  |
                  +-- NO → Infrastructure/network troubleshooting
```

Also capture:

* Deployment version
* Deployment time
* Last known good version
* Environment
* Error message
* HTTP status code
* Affected functionality
* Number of users affected
* Whether issue is reproducible
* Whether issue happens from all devices/networks

