# 11. Add "evidence collection" to every check

This is one of the most important improvements I'd recommend.

Don't make the process only:

> Check X → Pass/Fail

Instead:

```text
Check
 ↓
Result
 ↓
Evidence
 ↓
Conclusion
 ↓
Next action
```

Example:

```text
CHECK: Kubernetes Pod Status

Expected:
Pod = Running + Ready

Actual:
Pod = CrashLoopBackOff

Evidence:
Restart count = 12
Last error = connection timeout to MongoDB

Conclusion:
Application pod cannot establish MongoDB connection.

Next:
Execute MongoDB connectivity diagnostic.
```

Now your troubleshooting process becomes useful for **RCA** as well.

