This will make the system much easier to manage.

For example:

```text
NET-001   DNS resolution
NET-002   TCP connectivity
NET-003   HTTP connectivity
NET-004   Application Gateway backend health

K8S-001   Pod status
K8S-002   Pod readiness
K8S-003   Pod restart
K8S-004   Deployment status
K8S-005   Service endpoints
K8S-006   Kubernetes events

DB-001    MongoDB DNS
DB-002    MongoDB TCP
DB-003    MongoDB authentication
DB-004    MongoDB query

APP-001   Application health endpoint
APP-002   Application logs
APP-003   Login test
APP-004   Business transaction

DEP-001   CI/CD deployment
DEP-002   Image version
DEP-003   Rollout status
```

Then your incident report can say:

```text
Incident: INC-12345

Failed checks:

DEP-003 → Deployment rollout
K8S-002  → Pod readiness
DB-002   → MongoDB connectivity

Root cause:
Network connectivity between application pod and MongoDB.

Resolution:
Network configuration corrected.

Validation:
APP-003 → Login successful
APP-004 → Business transaction successful
```

That's much more professional and repeatable.

