# 13. Introduce severity levels

Not every failure should trigger the same response.

For example:

### P1 — Application unavailable

```text
Application Gateway
      ↓
Kubernetes
      ↓
Application
      ↓
MongoDB

Any critical failure → P1
```

### P2 — Major functionality broken

Application available but important functionality doesn't work.

### P3 — Minor functionality

One feature affected.

### P4 — Performance / warning

Application works but has degradation.

