# 17. Most important concept: dependency map

I would create a dependency matrix as the foundation.

| Component           | Depends On          | Test                     |
| ------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |
| User                | DNS                 | DNS lookup               |
| User                | Application Gateway | HTTPS                    |
| Application Gateway | Kubernetes          | Backend health           |
| Ingress             | Service             | Route test               |
| Service             | Pods                | Endpoint check           |
| Application         | MongoDB             | DB connectivity          |
| Application         | Secrets             | Secret/config validation |
| Application         | External APIs       | API connectivity         |
| CI/CD               | Container Registry  | Image availability       |
| CI/CD               | Kubernetes          | Deployment               |
| Application         | MongoDB             | Query test               |
| Business            | Application         | Test-user login          |

Once this matrix exists, your troubleshooting engine can automatically walk the dependency chain.

